ption":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":13,"description":"Captions available"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"260160","steamName":"The Last Tinker™: City of Colors","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/260160/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:43:03.365203+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"The Last Tinker is a joyous action adventure and definitely no platformer, as there is no jump button. Koru, a boy from the slums of Colortown, must rise and stand against the Bleakness, a dark force intent on wiping out joy. Koru must use color and emotion to restore life to Colortown!","detailedDescription":"Buzz\n\nAbout the Game\n\nThe Last Tinker is a vivid journey through Colortown, a world built upon creativity, emotion and collaboration. It's Mimimi's take on all-time classics like \"Jack and Daxter\" or \"Banjo-Kazooie\", while breaking the mold by not having a jump button.\n\nA dark force named The Bleakness has emerged and seeks to tear the colors apart, draining all joy and life from the world.\nKoru, a young boy from the slums of Colortown, takes action, though. He embarks on an epic adventure to face the Bleakness and to restore joy and color to his home.\n\nIt's a real throwback to the 90's. You can play the game with your kids or, even better, rediscover the kid in yourself, lean back and enjoy this colorful ride.","aboutGame":"The Last Tinker is a vivid journey through Colortown, a world built upon creativity, emotion and collaboration. It's Mimimi's take on all-time classics like \"Jack and Daxter\" or \"Banjo-Kazooie\", while breaking the mold by not having a jump button.\n\nA dark force named The Bleakness has emerged and seeks to tear the colors apart, draining all joy and life from the world.\nKoru, a young boy from the slums of Colortown, takes action, though. He embarks on an epic adventure to face the Bleakness and to restore joy and color to his home.\n\nIt's a real throwback to the 90's. You can play the game with your kids or, even better, rediscover the kid in yourself, lean back and enjoy this colorful ride."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/header.jpg?t=1789474537"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789474537"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_4fc7f76b78b6a532c860de55883ee1dc0971784f.600x338.jpg?t=1789474537","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_4fc7f76b78b6a532c860de55883ee1dc0971784f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789474537"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_abc6d1d40625432d1d6a951213cbd8fd97fcff30.600x338.jpg?t=1789474537","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_abc6d1d40625432d1d6a951213cbd8fd97fcff30.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789474537"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_aca888f3bd28d685d5d29b7c6357ce6fbca0fa78.600x338.jpg?t=1789474537","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_aca888f3bd28d685d5d29b7c6357ce6fbca0fa78.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789474537"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_343023e05e83c923300a189a92c5874016f82f41.600x338.jpg?t=1789474537","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/260160/ss_343023e05e83c923300a189a92c5874016f82f41.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789474537"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared